1
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:08,710
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>He's trying to live earnestly...</i></font>

2
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,570
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>But he's just so stupid.</i></font>

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:15,570
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Did you not think it was weird that 
nobody actually uses that armor?</font>

4
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:19,470
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">None of the Beast's Fangs 
members used it, right?</font>

5
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:27,140
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I just thought nobody else could 
get their hands on this armor.</font>

6
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:32,560
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I thought if I wore this, you'd 
stamp your feet in frustration...</font>

7
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,840
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm so frustrated!</font>

8
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,050
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">...and I could look down on you.</font>

9
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,520
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">His personality's rotten, too!</font>

10
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:54,580
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE
ENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE</font>

11
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:14,720
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I didn't choose to become an 
enchanter instead of an adventurer</font>

12
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,200
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">for any particular reason.</font>

13
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,240
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Where's your motivation?!</font>

14
00:02:17,460 --> 00:02:23,950
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">But I think I subconsciously chose 
the role with less responsibility.</font>

15
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:29,700
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">When you're an adventurer, your actions 
could hurt the people around you.</font>

16
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:34,150
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I guess he's not all bad.</font>

17
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I guess not.</font>

18
00:02:35,830 --> 00:02:39,730
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Now I'm scared of losing you two.</font>

19
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:46,310
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">The Radiant Dragon Ruins in Gadressa, 
the eastern capital, are dangerous, right?</font>

20
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:54,220
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">If we're discussing risks,
I shouldn't be adventuring anymore.</font>

21
00:02:54,220 --> 00:03:00,440
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">But still, I have to go to 
the Radiant Dragon Ruins.</font>

22
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:05,230
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">If Lily's going, I'm going.</font>

23
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:07,950
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I need to confirm why my sister died.</font>

24
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:07,950
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">But...</font>

25
00:03:08,770 --> 00:03:12,540
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">if you die before you achieve your goals, 
you won't be able to fulfill them.</font>

26
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,300
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Well...</font>

27
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:20,490
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm worried you'll get tunnel vision 
and won't retreat if things get dicey.</font>

28
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:24,050
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">So I have a request.</font>

29
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:28,310
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Let me lead this adventure.</font>

30
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:32,900
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You, the least experienced of us three?</font>

31
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:35,650
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I guess you're not over your 
habit of joking around.</font>

32
00:03:35,650 --> 00:03:39,050
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Naturally, I'll need your 
experience and advice,</font>

33
00:03:39,050 --> 00:03:42,510
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">but I think I can stay 
calmer than you two,</font>

34
00:03:42,510 --> 00:03:45,410
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">so I want you to let me have 
the final say in any decisions.</font>

35
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:49,910
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You mean we have to retreat if you say so?</font>

36
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:53,450
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Yeah. Naturally, we'd 
try again in that case.</font>

37
00:03:53,770 --> 00:03:55,000
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You're okay with that, right?</font>

38
00:03:58,620 --> 00:04:02,020
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I suppose. I'll leave it up to you two.</font>

39
00:04:02,540 --> 00:04:04,010
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Okay, Rein.</font>

40
00:04:04,290 --> 00:04:05,780
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You're our leader.</font>

41
00:04:05,780 --> 00:04:06,780
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Great!</font>

42
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:11,480
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Then put your equipment on 
the table. I'll enchant it.</font>

43
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:11,990
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Huh?</font>

44
00:04:11,990 --> 00:04:13,480
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">That's not necessary.</font>

45
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:16,190
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">How many times have 
I told you I don't need it?</font>

46
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:18,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You have to. Maybe it's not necessary 
to enchant your weapons,</font>

47
00:04:18,970 --> 00:04:21,490
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">but I'm enchanting your 
armor no matter what</font>

48
00:04:21,490 --> 00:04:23,840
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">so we can all make it back alive.</font>

49
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,610
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">That's my decision as party leader.</font>

50
00:04:27,030 --> 00:04:29,980
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Is this why you wanted to be the leader?</font>

51
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:30,870
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Yeah.</font>

52
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,930
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Then please enchant my gear, leader.</font>

53
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:43,140
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}THERE'S SOMETHING I'VE LEARNED FROM ENDING UP NAKED
TWICE... WHEN YOU'RE NAKED, YOU GET BITTEN TWICE.</font>

54
00:04:47,990 --> 00:04:51,930
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Lily, I applied 300 bonus 
points to your armor.</font>

55
00:04:51,930 --> 00:04:55,520
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">That's the current max I can 
apply to another person's armor.</font>

56
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,560
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Th-Three hundred?!</i></font>

57
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:02,670
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Even high-level enchanters can only 
grant between three and five points.</i></font>

58
00:05:03,010 --> 00:05:05,770
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>That's an impossible value.</i></font>

59
00:05:05,770 --> 00:05:09,210
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Margaret, let me see your armor, too.</font>

60
00:05:10,030 --> 00:05:14,490
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I've adventured without owing 
any debts or favors until now.</font>

61
00:05:14,490 --> 00:05:16,890
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I don't want to owe you anything.</font>

62
00:05:16,890 --> 00:05:19,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You won't owe me anything.</font>

63
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:23,260
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm just doing what I can 
because we're going together.</font>

64
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,810
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Because we're allies.</font>

65
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,980
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Allies?</font>

66
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:31,260
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">My sister...</font>

67
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:38,300
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">My sister trusted her allies, 
but she died while adventuring.</font>

68
00:05:38,610 --> 00:05:42,900
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">The allies you trust to watch 
your back sometimes run away.</font>

69
00:05:44,050 --> 00:05:47,570
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">So I don't need allies.</font>

70
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:49,580
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">But—</font>

71
00:05:49,580 --> 00:05:51,370
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">This conversation is over.</font>

72
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:55,130
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Please leave. We'll meet again 
when it's time to depart.</font>

73
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:00,390
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Leave!</font>

74
00:06:11,690 --> 00:06:15,770
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Margaret, come eat with us over there.</font>

75
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:21,450
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Half of those adventurers 
are already dead.</i></font>

76
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:25,200
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>That woman made a stupid mistake,</i></font>

77
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,130
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>and her allies paid 
for it with their lives.</i></font>

78
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:36,550
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Maybe adventuring with allies is more fun.</i></font>

79
00:06:36,550 --> 00:06:39,300
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>We could even help each other.</i></font>

80
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:43,910
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>But allies are a sweet 
nectar tainted with poison.</i></font>

81
00:06:44,810 --> 00:06:48,920
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I've always survived on my strength alone.</i></font>

82
00:06:50,090 --> 00:06:51,300
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Let's go for a—</font>

83
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:59,000
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing, Rein?!</font>

84
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,920
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I was waiting for you.</font>

85
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,940
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Naked while being bitten by a dog?!</font>

86
00:07:02,940 --> 00:07:05,500
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">My clothes are enchanted.</font>

87
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:08,450
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">They're tough enough to screw up 
someone's hand if they hit me.</font>

88
00:07:08,450 --> 00:07:11,200
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I did this to save the 
dog's teeth when it bit me.</font>

89
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,820
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I stripped for the dog!</font>

90
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:14,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}MY FIRST SEXY EXPERIENCE</font>

91
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:14,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You stripped for the dog?!</font>

92
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:16,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Are you okay?</font>

93
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,440
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Yeah, I'm totally fine.</font>

94
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:22,630
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}I'm always telling you 
not to eat weird stuff.</font>

95
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:26,810
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>She was talking to the dog, 
not me. So politely, too.</i></font>

96
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:24,220
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}Please be more careful.</font>

97
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:27,210
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}There's bacteria everywhere. 
Parasites, too.</font>

98
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:30,230
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}It's raw. You have to cook it first.</font>

99
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:33,320
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>She must not open up to anyone 
if she speaks formally to dogs.</i></font>

100
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:33,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}It's best to cook it until 
it's a little burnt.</font>

101
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:40,310
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I can't bring your master with 
me unless I enchant her armor.</font>

102
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:43,440
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Could you help me keep her 
here until she lets me—</font>

103
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,540
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">All done.</font>

104
00:07:50,870 --> 00:07:52,820
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Now this is +300, too.</font>

105
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,240
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I can't put a single scratch on it.</i></font>

106
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,620
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Well, Margaret? Nice, right?</font>

107
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:03,230
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Shit. It really is +300.</i></font>

108
00:08:03,230 --> 00:08:06,190
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>If Lily's armor has the same enchantment,</i></font>

109
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:09,300
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I can't kill her with this sword.</i></font>

110
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:13,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rein, could you enchant 
this sword, as well?</font>

111
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:17,450
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Here, Rein.</font>

112
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:22,100
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">It's my spare armor.
Take it with my gratitude.</font>

113
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:27,180
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm nobody's ally, so neither 
of us owe each other anything.</font>

114
00:08:30,010 --> 00:08:31,770
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">See you later, Margaret.</font>

115
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:38,800
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Now I can kill her once she's exhausted.</i></font>

116
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:44,050
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What is it, Rein? Did you forget...</font>

117
00:08:45,810 --> 00:08:49,290
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Cornelius of the Beast's Fangs and...</font>

118
00:08:49,290 --> 00:08:51,140
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Who are you?</font>

119
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:54,470
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We're kidnapping Rein. Join us.</font>

120
00:08:54,470 --> 00:08:58,180
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Did you already forget 
that he beat you once?</font>

121
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">And I don't work with weak—</font>

122
00:08:59,830 --> 00:09:00,730
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We're coming in.</font>

123
00:09:00,730 --> 00:09:02,260
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Hey, wait!</font>

124
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,820
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You can't invite yourselves into—</font>

125
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:11,480
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I see. You seem like you'd 
be able to kidnap Rein,</font>

126
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:16,410
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Vice Guildmaster of the 
Beast's Fangs, Glenda.</font>

127
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:21,310
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">The Beast's Fangs are 
pursuing a new direction.</font>

128
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:25,570
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We'll kidnap and imprison Rein and 
force him to enchant our gear.</font>

129
00:09:25,570 --> 00:09:29,850
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">With his enchantment abilities, our 
former members will come back to us.</font>

130
00:09:30,540 --> 00:09:33,130
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">And you're going after Rein with...</font>

131
00:09:33,530 --> 00:09:37,610
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Cornelius, I told you to find an assassin.</font>

132
00:09:38,740 --> 00:09:41,180
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Is that child her?</font>

133
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:43,180
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">An assassin?</font>

134
00:09:43,530 --> 00:09:47,220
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I doubt that child could kill Lily.</font>

135
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:49,230
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You're so useless.</font>

136
00:09:51,130 --> 00:09:54,400
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Shut up, hag. I-I'll kill you.</font>

137
00:10:09,130 --> 00:10:12,960
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">C-Cornelius, what—</font>

138
00:10:13,250 --> 00:10:17,040
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I don't give a shit 
about the Beast's Fangs.</font>

139
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:20,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Killing Rein and Lily is 
more important to me.</font>

140
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:24,820
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Otherwise, I'll remain a laughingstock 
in this business forever!</font>

141
00:10:32,490 --> 00:10:36,730
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Mirabel, you've proven your strength.</font>

142
00:10:36,730 --> 00:10:41,910
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm formally hiring you to 
kill Lily. Here's your pay.</font>

143
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,610
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Sorry about that, Margaret.</font>

144
00:10:46,550 --> 00:10:48,640
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We'll clean up the body.</font>

145
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:52,550
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Of course you will. And I will kill Lily.</font>

146
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:55,340
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">If you'll agree not to 
interfere with my plans,</font>

147
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:58,260
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'll tell you when Rein 
and Lily are leaving,</font>

148
00:10:58,260 --> 00:11:01,700
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">where they're going, about their 
equipment, and anything else.</font>

149
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:06,590
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I've heard about your feud with 
Lily. I won't get in your way.</font>

150
00:11:06,980 --> 00:11:12,860
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm just going to kill Rein 
whether you like it or not.</font>

151
00:11:54,470 --> 00:11:56,620
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Gadressa, the royal capital.</i></font>

152
00:12:07,310 --> 00:12:11,370
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Located a two-hour carriage 
ride from the capital are...</i></font>

153
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:24,050
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We're finally here.</font>

154
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:27,420
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">So that's the notoriously 
difficult dungeon,</font>

155
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,670
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">the Radiant Dragon Ruins.</font>

156
00:12:30,570 --> 00:12:32,460
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>The Radiant Dragon Ruins.</i></font>

157
00:12:33,380 --> 00:12:42,730
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>In their depths is the radiant blade said 
to possess the power of dragons, Lefaid.</i></font>

158
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:49,710
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}LEFAID</font>

159
00:12:42,730 --> 00:12:46,230
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>It is defended by a high-level dragon in 
the ruins on the outskirts of Gadressa,</i></font>

160
00:12:46,230 --> 00:12:48,810
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>the Kingdom of Dragons.</i></font>

161
00:12:59,730 --> 00:13:02,460
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What a big temple.</font>

162
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:09,670
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Lily, is there anything we should watch 
out for? What's it like in there?</font>

163
00:13:10,370 --> 00:13:14,980
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm sorry, Margaret. I don't 
remember anything about the ruins.</font>

164
00:13:15,860 --> 00:13:20,810
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">All I remember is feeling powerlessness 
and despair. That's all.</font>

165
00:13:21,650 --> 00:13:24,600
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I see. Then let's get moving.</font>

166
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>This is stupid.</i></font>

167
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:35,690
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>She doesn't remember 
anything? There's no way.</i></font>

168
00:13:37,630 --> 00:13:41,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Wow, so this is a dungeon.</font>

169
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:43,480
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Don't get distracted. It's not safe.</font>

170
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:49,390
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I still believe Lily abandoned 
everyone and fled.</font>

171
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,540
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What do you think, Rein?</font>

172
00:13:51,980 --> 00:13:54,170
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I don't think she did.</font>

173
00:13:54,640 --> 00:14:00,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'm hoping we can confirm that 
here so you two can make up.</font>

174
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:01,230
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What?</font>

175
00:14:01,230 --> 00:14:04,730
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Your sister and Lily were allies, right?</font>

176
00:14:04,730 --> 00:14:08,700
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I bet your sister would 
want you to get along.</font>

177
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:13,340
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I've been tracking Lily's movements.</font>

178
00:14:14,170 --> 00:14:16,520
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I heard she can't fight anymore.</font>

179
00:14:16,970 --> 00:14:20,580
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">But if she's here, 
that must be a lie, too.</font>

180
00:14:21,710 --> 00:14:23,420
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You can fight, can't you?</font>

181
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:28,490
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Fighting still makes Lily shake 
too badly to hold a sword.</font>

182
00:14:28,490 --> 00:14:30,080
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">She can't do anything.</font>

183
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:32,030
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">But she still teaches me, 
a novice adventurer,</font>

184
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:34,520
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">using her knowledge and experience.</font>

185
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:37,650
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">That's why I'm with Lily right now.</font>

186
00:14:37,650 --> 00:14:38,990
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">This is stupid.</font>

187
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,690
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Margaret...</font>

188
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:44,940
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>So she came even though she can't fight?</i></font>

189
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,690
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I don't believe it.</i></font>

190
00:14:48,170 --> 00:14:50,280
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>They must both be stupid.</i></font>

191
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:56,200
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I'm always the only one 
taking shit seriously.</i></font>

192
00:15:11,230 --> 00:15:13,050
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Oh?</font>

193
00:15:13,290 --> 00:15:15,290
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">They call this place impregnable,</font>

194
00:15:15,290 --> 00:15:18,660
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">but it's got the same 
goblins you'd see anywhere.</font>

195
00:15:19,530 --> 00:15:21,810
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Come at me, weaklings.</font>

196
00:15:32,230 --> 00:15:38,450
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I'm here now because you might try 
to hide evidence of the past, Lily.</i></font>

197
00:15:39,450 --> 00:15:42,330
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Right now, you're just a useless coward.</i></font>

198
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:47,000
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Now that I'm here, I have to progress, 
even if I have to do it alone.</i></font>

199
00:15:50,780 --> 00:15:56,120
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Crap. If they all attack me at once, 
they'll stab each other, but...</i></font>

200
00:15:56,510 --> 00:15:59,600
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>This is why they call 
this place impregnable.</i></font>

201
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:04,260
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Lily?!</font>

202
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:05,270
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Don't move! Stay down!</font>

203
00:16:17,210 --> 00:16:18,320
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Margaret.</font>

204
00:16:20,290 --> 00:16:25,500
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I was worried your armor couldn't 
block all their attacks and panicked.</font>

205
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,130
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You managed to move.</font>

206
00:16:31,130 --> 00:16:31,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Huh?</font>

207
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:36,610
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I thought you shook too much 
to do anything in battle.</font>

208
00:16:41,330 --> 00:16:45,190
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I hope you'll gain the ability 
to wield a sword next.</font>

209
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:48,420
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">So do I.</font>

210
00:16:57,440 --> 00:17:01,400
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">From now on, I'll stick with you two.</font>

211
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:02,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Great.</font>

212
00:17:07,810 --> 00:17:08,710
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rein?</font>

213
00:17:09,530 --> 00:17:10,920
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I heard something.</font>

214
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:15,260
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">More importantly, Rein, why is your 
sword so extraordinarily power—</font>

215
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:26,280
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">It's collapsing! Run!</font>

216
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:29,770
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Your attacks are so excessive!</font>

217
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:32,150
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Just how much did you enchant that thing?!</font>

218
00:17:32,150 --> 00:17:33,880
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Huh? Well, actually...</font>

219
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,680
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Seriously, what the hell?!</font>

220
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,950
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rein, behind you!</font>

221
00:17:43,790 --> 00:17:44,510
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Stay back!</font>

222
00:18:01,050 --> 00:18:02,880
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Who even cares about him?!</font>

223
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Did we need to focus on him?!</font>

224
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:10,370
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">W-We survived.</font>

225
00:18:10,370 --> 00:18:12,930
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We're completely lost now, though.</font>

226
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:14,010
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rein.</font>

227
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:19,240
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Your sword broke again. 
How many did you bring?</font>

228
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:22,890
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I still have more than 20 left.</font>

229
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:25,290
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">When my cheap enchanted swords break,</font>

230
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:29,500
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I retrieve their bonus points and 
transfer them to a new sword.</font>

231
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:32,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I always keep two enchanted.</font>

232
00:18:32,970 --> 00:18:35,480
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">That's my best option right now.</font>

233
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:38,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>So he's not acting completely 
without thinking.</i></font>

234
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:42,010
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'll transfer the points now. 
Give me a minute.</font>

235
00:18:43,770 --> 00:18:46,300
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Feel free to chat while you're waiting.</font>

236
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:53,500
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">N-Nice weather we're having.</font>

237
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:55,680
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Uh, yeah.</font>

238
00:18:58,330 --> 00:19:02,100
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Have you remembered anything 
since entering the ruins?</font>

239
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:06,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">No, nothing.</font>

240
00:19:15,370 --> 00:19:16,630
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I...</font>

241
00:19:18,490 --> 00:19:21,780
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">think I passed through here before.</font>

242
00:19:23,860 --> 00:19:26,790
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">With the others.</font>

243
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:32,750
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I should remember more if we keep going.</font>

244
00:19:38,290 --> 00:19:40,140
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>That last goblin...</i></font>

245
00:19:41,050 --> 00:19:44,520
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I happened to hit him, 
but if he had survived...</i></font>

246
00:19:45,690 --> 00:19:49,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>These swords aren't good enough. 
I can't protect the two of them.</i></font>

247
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:54,170
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>Lefaid will be mine.</i></font>

248
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:02,010
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">It's an old gold coin!</font>

249
00:20:02,950 --> 00:20:06,320
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>This is the first treasure 
I acquired on an adventure.</i></font>

250
00:20:06,710 --> 00:20:08,790
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>I'm a real adventurer now.</i></font>

251
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,930
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rein.</font>

252
00:20:10,150 --> 00:20:11,700
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What did you just pick up?</font>

253
00:20:11,700 --> 00:20:14,460
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Was it treasure? Show us.</font>

254
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:17,670
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">It's customary to split 
any treasure you find.</font>

255
00:20:17,670 --> 00:20:21,320
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">If you don't, it usually 
turns into a fight.</font>

256
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:22,410
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">No way!</font>

257
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:24,720
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Please don't fight!</font>

258
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:25,400
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Just show us.</font>

259
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:27,240
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Why are you so infuriating?</font>

260
00:20:28,740 --> 00:20:30,040
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">This coin is nice.</font>

261
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:31,650
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Yeah.</font>

262
00:20:34,940 --> 00:20:36,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Can I keep this, Margaret?</font>

263
00:20:36,970 --> 00:20:40,330
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Yes. I owe you for saving me earlier.</font>

264
00:20:40,330 --> 00:20:41,080
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rein.</font>

265
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:45,190
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You can have this coin as a souvenir.</font>

266
00:20:45,190 --> 00:20:46,960
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">We'll make an exception this time.</font>

267
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:52,330
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Lily, Margaret...</font>

268
00:20:52,650 --> 00:20:53,850
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Thank you!</font>

269
00:20:54,690 --> 00:20:56,650
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">You're done enchanting your gear, right?</font>

270
00:20:56,650 --> 00:20:58,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Let's keep going.</font>

271
00:20:58,250 --> 00:20:59,690
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Yeah, let's go.</font>

272
00:21:07,210 --> 00:21:08,760
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">There's something on the ground again.</font>

273
00:21:09,290 --> 00:21:10,310
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What is it this time?</font>

274
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:12,200
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Don't forget, we split 
the treasure evenly.</font>

275
00:21:12,420 --> 00:21:15,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What? This can't be mine, either?</font>

276
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:18,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">A piece of paper? What does it say?</font>

277
00:21:18,250 --> 00:21:20,860
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Don't keep us waiting. 
Tell us what it says.</font>

278
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:28,440
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>"Lily Flambert killed us"?</i></font>

279
00:21:29,790 --> 00:21:31,940
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">What does it say?</font>

280
00:21:31,940 --> 00:21:32,920
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Show us, Rein.</font>

281
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:35,350
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">It's, uh...</font>

282
00:21:35,770 --> 00:21:37,420
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Show us.</font>

283
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:39,680
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Why are you hiding it, Rein?</font>

284
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:44,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Come on, guys! Cut it out!</font>

285
00:21:44,250 --> 00:21:47,610
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I'll just stick this in my clothes!</font>

286
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:50,660
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">This armor is massively enchanted!</font>

287
00:21:50,660 --> 00:21:52,620
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">No matter how much you 
pull on it, it's pointless!</font>

288
00:21:53,660 --> 00:21:54,640
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Give that back!</font>

289
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:57,120
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">I didn't enchant my clothes!</font>

290
00:21:57,120 --> 00:21:58,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Show us the paper!</font>

291
00:21:58,380 --> 00:21:59,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Show us!</font>

292
00:21:59,380 --> 00:22:02,710
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">S-Stop! If you don't stop pulling...</font>

293
00:22:47,670 --> 00:22:49,180
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}LILY</font>

294
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,510
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}SHE SAID REIN!!</font>

295
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,510
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}IS SHE...</font>

296
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,510
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}TALKING ABOUT MEEE?!</font>

297
00:22:54,510 --> 00:22:59,520
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}TRANSLATION: SHO STIFLER
TIMING: ANDY ELLIS</font>

